{"id":"sw-c63a81","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Factual check: game/industry war stories across ch01-06","description":"The comparison retrofits verified engine API claims; the game/industry anecdotes across ch01-06 have not been systematically fact-checked (ch05's pass caught a Sekiro/Elden Ring misattribution and an unsupported Cyberpunk claim, proving the error class is real).\n\nMethod: extract every checkable war-story claim per chapter (titles, dates, studios, attributions, numbers), triage into well-established vs. needs-verification, web-verify the suspect set, fix misattributions, add precision, hedge the unverifiable. Known suspects going in: ch04's Dark Souls weapon-degradation story (likely Dark Souls II), Naughty Dog's PS3-era threading characterization, the HZD/Destiny 2 DRS examples, Xbox GDK DRS API claim, Overwatch \"60 Hz\" tick precision.\n\nMerge note: branch edits must stay disjoint from the five unmerged comparison-retrofit branches (war-story paragraphs vs. comparison paragraphs); merge after them.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":2,"sort_order":"a0","dependencies":[{"source_id":"sw-c63a81","target_id":"sw-438537","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["book","revision","fact-check"]},"created_at":"2026-08-19T14:47:06.892208Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.235 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
