{"id":"sw-c63a81","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ce9a4043-3c5a-4e17-af40-fe30eaa57408","text":"## Done (on issue branches, merge pending batch tophat)\n\nSweep method: ch03/ch04 claims triaged from the lead pass's full reads; ch01/ch02/ch06 extracted by three subagents (~70 claims classified); suspect set web-verified. Fixes routed to whichever branch owned the conflict zone.\n\n**Flat errors fixed:**\n- ch04: *Dark Souls* → ***Dark Souls II*** weapon-degradation story (verified: 60 fps versions, ~2× wear, patched post-launch).\n- ch06: Unix fd \"kernel tracks a sequence number\" claim was false (POSIX has no fd generations; fd-reuse is a real bug class) — rewritten so the *absence* of generations strengthens the slot-map argument.\n- ch06: Bungie/Halo input-replay and Naughty Dog TLOU2 replay-testing anecdotes could not be sourced (likely fabricated) — replaced with the verified Rare *Sea of Thieves* GDC 2019 talk (Masella); same fix in the ch22 stub.\n- ch02/ch03/ch06/ch12-stub: `FSceneProxy` → `FPrimitiveSceneProxy` (not a real UE type); ch06's `FRenderResource` \"opaque indices\" and Unity \"generational\" InstanceID claims corrected.\n- ch06: wgpu adapter-info memory query doesn't exist — rewritten to platform queries + per-tier defaults; Godot `push_debug_group` API name corrected to debug label regions.\n- ch01: verbatim duplicated DOOM sentence removed.\n\n**Precision/hedges:** ch01 home-computer era + hardware sprites (C64 only) + NES audio phrasing + Quake licensing (\"dozens\"→Wolf3D/Doom lineage, Raven/Valve named, \"open-world experiments\" dropped) + Godot \"open-sourced in 2014\"; ch02 Doom-entanglement softened, PhysicsServer3D naming, Unity 7 URP-default/HDRP-maintenance note added per author, \"rejects cycles\" and Godot-init absolutes softened (on sw-e1cbe3), \"unrepresentable\" → explicit-and-opt-in, UE RHI-handles → render-graph handles; ch03 Overwatch \"millions of concurrent\" → \"tens of millions of players\", ND PS3 story reframed to SPU-jobs reality (on sw-2f2873); ch04 DRS examples (*Doom* 2016 + *Destiny 2*, HZD removed, unverifiable Xbox GDK API sentence dropped), Skyrim \"capped\"→\"tied\"; ch06 cert/iOS absolutes softened (on sw-c65b57); Tracy \"over a decade\"→\"nearly a decade\"; VTune \"cannot\"→\"without annotation\".\n\n**Verified-correct, no change:** Overwatch 60 Hz sim, Xbox 360 specs, Bilas GDC 2002, Hoare 1978, Gyrling GDC 2015, id Tech 4/UE3 render-thread history, Pong/Atari 2600, Far Cry/Crysis, Source titles, Ageia PhysX, Tracy/Perfetto/VTune/PIX/Instruments, UE/Unity profiler APIs, wgpu backend matrix.\n\nAll four touched branches render clean. Merge order: retrofit branches first, then this one."},"created_at":"2026-08-19T15:04:18.632409Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.235 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
